.TH "BANDE-SESSION" "1" "" "bande-compositor" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
bande\-session \- start a Bande desktop session
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bande\-session
.SH DESCRIPTION
Starts the Bande compositor and the session services in the user's systemd
manager and waits until the session ends. A display manager runs it from the
Bande session entry; it refuses to start a second session while one is
running. When the session fails, ends as soon as it starts or is refused, it
leaves a note in
.I /var/lib/bande\-greeter/failed
that the login window shows the next time it offers that person.
